A CLOSED account cannot be changed back through the normal status API.

Closing an already CLOSED account returns a business validation error.

Hard delete was not introduced; lifecycle state preserves the account record.

13. Duplicate Account Protection

Current project rule:

One CHECKING account per customer

One SAVINGS account per customer

One CREDIT account per customer

The rule is enforced twice: a service-level existence check gives a friendly response, and Oracle enforces UNIQUE (CUSTOMER_ID, ACCOUNT_TYPE) as the final concurrency-safe integrity layer.

